        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Friction Type Hold-Open Arm Assembly</b>\r\n<p>\r\nStandard duty friction type hold-open door closer arm for regular, top jamb or parallel arm mounting. <br>\r\n<b>Note: </b>For Hold Open to function properly when regular or top jamb mounting the door closer, door must open a minimum of 90 degrees.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with Global Door Controls TC200 series, TC2200 series, TC400 series, TC500 series, TC600 series or any door closer with a 12mm square shaft.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> Global  HOA-1245 Hold Open Closer Arm\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Arm Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Forearm Length: Min: 10-1/4\" Max: 15-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Thread: 10mm 1.25</li>\r\n<li>Closer Shaft Mounting Hole: 12mm Square</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<b>**This item is Discontinued. Use <a href=\"/products/door-closer-friction-hold-open-arm-global-hoa-1245-n\">Global HOA-1245-N Hold Open Arm</a></b>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n</p>",
